#text(size:16pt,weight:"bold")[Why local minors are a control, not the answer]

For neighboring original S3 quadratics in one projective slot, write
#raw("F=aU²+bUV+cV²; G=dU²+eUV+fV²;
L=ae−bd; M=af−cd; N=bf−ce; R=M²−LN.
V(LU+MV)=aG−dF.
V²(MU+NV)=(aU+bV)G−(dU+eV)F.
V³R=[a(MV−LU)−LbV]G+[−d(MV−LU)+LeV]F.",block:true)
The last identity has a prior compiled owner. All three are hand algebra
here and exact identity-check contracts in the UNEXECUTED modular source.
A common D³ witness follows by multiplying each local witness by D³/V^k,
where D is the product of all denominators. The family has at most4m−7
generators; resultant total degree at most16 on original S3 rows.

But for m≥4 every vertex has a neighboring projective slot. A boundary
linear subresultant has degree1 in its own slot and2 in the neighbor. Its
resultant has degree4 in the neighbor. Interior versions have more degree.
All nonzero generators have total projective degree at least2. Their centered
integer lifts and ordinary powers still satisfy the prior filtration.
Balanced H≥sqrt(p) therefore excludes the usual HHG-short certificate.
Length3 is an explicit exception. Constant degree alone missed this charge.

*The source pipeline.* Fix an interval point catalog, then form mixed targets.
Only each point reaches the selector, with labels outside it. Substitute
(U+tau V,V) into each internal chart. Modes: ordinary, explicit local minors,
or full modular saturation. Check D^n g=sum(A_i F_i) before lifting. Enumerate
a declared finite shift family, charge every row, and group by projective
multidegree. Check the exact LLL transformation and scale divisibility;
promote a nonzero polynomial only after its integer L1 is below p^t.

Dehomogenize only after homogeneous integer vanishing. Check lex Groebner
membership in both directions and critical pairs, then admit finite LEAF
recovery through a capped exact monomial staircase. Projected roots may be
extra: filter through catalog indices, original occurrences/signs and actual
point sums. No bounded-ratio reconstruction or completeness is claimed.

Incremental catalog cancellation retains original target provenance. Recover
−A/B only for B≠0 and verify scalar multiplication. Separate source replay
checks every relation and scalar without lattice/root finding. Its code and
producer booleans are not an independent signed verifier. Uniform-label
probability is conditional; fixed/censored pilot runs do not establish it.

